---
/**
 * 首页热门排行榜：浏览 / 点击 + 今日热榜（engagement.js 填充）
 * 与 AI 简报并排，默认展开，避免被 details 折叠淹没。
 */
---

<section class="home-section fade-in home-ops-rank" id="home-ops" data-ops-ready="0">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="section-kicker">今日热度</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">热门排行榜</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">按今日点击排序 · 本机即时统计</p>
  </div>

  <p class="ops-updated" id="ops-updated" aria-live="polite">
    <span class="ops-live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span id="ops-updated-text">同步中…</span>
  </p>

  <div class="ops-summary" role="group" aria-label="关键指标">
    <div class="ops-stat">
      <span class="ops-stat-label">浏览量</span>
      <strong class="ops-stat-value" id="ops-views">—</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="ops-stat">
      <span class="ops-stat-label">点击量</span>
      <strong class="ops-stat-value" id="ops-clicks">—</strong>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ops-trend">
    <div class="ops-trend-head">
      <h3 class="ops-trend-title">今日热榜</h3>
      <span class="ops-trend-hint">Top 6</span>
    </div>
    <ul class="ops-trend-list" id="ops-trend-list">
      <li class="ops-trend-empty">正在加载热度…</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
